## STANDING LINES
- **SHELL.** Never `cd` (a hook refuses it); absolute single-quoted paths (they hold spaces and `!`); `git -C`; `bash -c` with ARRAYS or a QUOTED heredoc for chains, bash not zsh for loops (zsh does not split an unquoted `$VAR`; write `${VAR}:path`, never `$VAR:path`); no unquoted word that starts with `=`. **A word-split path wrote stray zero-byte files named `=`, `MPS` and `Commercial` into the project root before (they, `seller` and a 6491-byte `head-B104CarePackApiTests.cs` still sit there, and a text file named `Datasec` one level up): CREATE NONE, touch none, never run `python3` or any interpreter on a path that could split; every path in a script is quoted or in an array.** `python3 -I` for anything reading a file you did not write. `/usr/bin/grep -i` with a positive control for every count; every count in STATUS is printed by the command that makes it. Clock from `date`, never typed.
- **Git in the project repo: READ verbs only** (`ls-remote`, `log`, `show`, `diff`, `cat-file`, `ls-tree`, `rev-parse`, `rev-list`, `merge-base`, `grep`, `config` reads, all `--no-optional-locks`) and `fetch` of your refspecs ONLY inside your own clone. FORBIDDEN in the project repo: `fetch`, `pull`, `merge`, `merge-tree --write-tree`, `worktree`, `checkout`, `stash`, `commit`, `reset`, `clean`, `gc`, `prune`. **Never delete** (`mv` to `.tools/b576/quarantine/`); no `rm`.
- **Findings only:** no merge, deploy, Jira write, PR, comment, push, mail, no Artifact/Docs/chat/publish tool, no decision-queue tool in any form (not even `list`), no fleet-ack tool, no scoreboard, no glob over `2_Project_Files/fleet/briefs_staged/`. HTTP only to GitHub GETs under the project's `GH_CONFIG_DIR` and the NuGet restore into your own home. No HTTP to any production or hosted host.
- **No person's name, no decision-card id and no ticket key anywhere in a file you write except STATUS** (say "the product owner"); STATUS carries no person's name either (git author fields hold one: do not quote them). Synthetic data only. 0 non-ASCII bytes in every scratch file and in STATUS (`LC_ALL=C /usr/bin/grep -c '[^ -~]'` = 0; control: a planted raw byte counts 1). STATUS carries no four-underscore run.
- **PRIOR WORK (verify, do not trust):** `git log --oneline 7809cd80 -- <each of the two paths>` (the builder: only `ad333d6` touches the Guard file; the Remainder file has no history), `git log --oneline 7809cd80..4ef1adcb`, and a `git grep -n -F` at the head over `tests/MpsCalc.Engine.Tests` for `ContractDifference`, `Remainder`, `Numerics`, `IsWholeNumber` (the builder: no committed row before this delta pinned an unrounded recomputed side; `ContractDifference` only on `ExactDeal`); a claim that rests on a history that does not say that is a finding.

